Items keep their b/u/c and +/- status when polypiled, but they get
recharged.  A cursed +2 orcish helmet could end up a cursed +2
pair of leather gloves.  A blessed +2 ring of increase damage could
end up a blessed ring of resist cold, then a blessed +2 ring of
increase strength.  Where the charging comes in is with wands
and books.  Books move towards blank but they don't show that
fact until you try to read them.



